IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `fla-family`

-- Family Law Act 1975 (Cth), with rr 4.01 and 15.15 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Family Law) Rules 2021
-- -- worked cases, from the seat of the separating parent and spouse.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked against a
-- decided case or registry practice. Where a section heading names a life event (jake k070, k073), the facts are Jake's, from the
-- Western Australian cradle-to-grave scenario: Jake (an Australian citizen, born in Perth) married Tahlia on 16 September 2033;
-- their daughter Ruby was born on 22 January 2033, before the marriage; they separated on 1 June 2038, Tahlia and Ruby moving to
-- her mother's, with a parenting plan; the divorce is heard on 20 August 2039, with almost nothing to settle. The filing date
-- (10 June 2039), the sole application, the same-day s 55A declaration and the signed, dated plan are ASSUMED; the life does not
-- state them.
--
-- Generated by scratchpad gen_family-law-act-1975_baseline.py. Expected results were written by hand from the text.

